默认情况为大端模式，将内部存储的信息按照大端模式存入输入的数组中

Purpose: Stores a bit stream into the packer.
Operation: Copies bits into m_bits, handling endianness.
Key feature: Allows direct input of bit data for packing.

```systemverilog
function void uvm_packer::put_bits (ref bit bitstream []);

  int bit_size;

  bit_size = bitstream.size();

  if(big_endian)
    for (int i=bit_size-1;i>=0;i--)
      m_bits[i] = bitstream[i];
  else
    for (int i=0;i<bit_size;i++)
      m_bits[i] = bitstream[i];

  m_packed_size = bit_size;
  count = 0;

endfunction
